allanting</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.300" end="00:20.910"><span begin="00:18.300" end="00:18.840">Cold </span><span begin="00:18.840" end="00:19.140">and </span><span begin="00:19.140" end="00:19.620">alone</span><span begin="00:19.620" end="00:19.620">, </span><span begin="00:19.620" end="00:19.830">it </span><span begin="00:19.830" end="00:20.220">suits </span><span begin="00:20.220" end="00:20.460">you </span><span begin="00:20.460" end="00:20.910">well</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.910" end="00:23.970"><span begin="00:20.910" end="00:21.000">You </span><span begin="00:21.000" end="00:21.270">won't </span><span begin="00:21.270" end="00:21.690">find </span><span begin="00:21.690" end="00:21.930">me </span><span begin="00:21.930" end="00:22.500">perching </span><span begin="00:22.500" end="00:23.010">here </span><span begin="00:23.010" end="00:23.970">again</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.350" end="00:28.980"><span begin="00:25.350" end="00:25.830">May </span><span begin="00:25.830" end="00:26.460">your </span><span begin="00:26.460" end="00:27.060">feet </span><span begin="00:27.060" end="00:27.660">serve </span><span begin="00:27.660" end="00:28.080">you </span><span begin="00:28.080" end="00:28.980">well</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.190" end="00:31.590"><span begin="00:29.190" end="00:29.370">And </span><span begin="00:29.370" end="00:29.490">the </span><span begin="00:29.490" end="00:30.060">rest </span><span begin="00:30.060" end="00:30.270">be </span><span begin="00:30.270" end="00:30.660">sent </span><span begin="00:30.660" end="00:30.840">to </span><span begin="00:30.840" end="00:31.590">Hell</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.620" end="00:33.900"><span begin="00:31.620" end="00:31.980">Where </span><span begin="00:31.980" end="00:32.160">they </span><span begin="00:32.160" end="00:33.000">always </span><span begin="00:33.000" end="00:33.270">have </span><span begin="00:33.270" end="00:33.900">belonged</s